to the director, even more than he could imagine. Schnitzler’s Casanova is aged, glory days are over: he lost his charm and his attraction to women, he’s broke and no more eager to travel through Europe. After a long exile, he just wants to go back to Venice, his homeland. While traveling home Casanova meets a girl, Marcolina. She reawakens his desire, lost for years. So, he tries to seduce her but that leads him to a tragic understanding: he’s an old man now. It’s not by chance that Leo Bernardi decided to tell this story right now, in a pivotal moment of his life and career. The destiny of both Casanova and his director leads them to a final confrontation."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c4Jo4vgLGK5pByuKHzAtVxmdvMT.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wgTaAKgLvm0ekUvf68D2LFu60fb.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":802124,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c4Jo4vgLGK5pByuKHzAtVxmdvMT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c4Jo4vgLGK5pByuKHzAtVxmdvMT.jpg","language":"it","width":1334,"height":2000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c4Jo4vgLGK5pByuKHzAtVxmdvMT.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c4Jo4vgLGK5pByuKHzAtVxmdvMT.jpg","language":"it","width":1334,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i7PWcd7BfLZgNkUqVYwWLsSV6y1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i7PWcd7BfLZgNkUqVYwWLsSV6y1.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1600}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://